{"id": "EUVD-2026-91134", "enisaUuid": "fd441875-4f42-37e8-8f2a-9c869df6b7ba", "description": "Mooncake transfer engine through 0.3.13.post1 contains a denial of service vulnerability that allows unauthenticated remote attackers to block the handshake daemon by never reading replies. Attackers can send a Metadata request to the handshake RPC port and stall SocketHandShakePlugin's single listener thread in writeFully(), breaking all subsequent handshakes, metadata fetches, notify and probe requests.", "datePublished": "2026-10-01T22:53:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-02T15:50:58", "baseScore": 8.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/4443", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/719735896c86b56fabec6cf3e825fb2ea640597a/mooncake-transfer-engine/src/transfer_metadata_plugin.cpp#L730-L803", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mooncake-transfer-engine-through-0.3.13-post1-denial-of-service-via-p2p-handshake-daemon-response-write"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mmqv-rpx9-mqhx", "CVE-2026-103760"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.4, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5609b568-cdb3-38b2-9e3e-c6b0792dcf30", "product": {"name": "mooncake", "vendor": {"name": "kvcache-ai"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.3.13.post1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "99250673-4970-3ff8-938b-a22f7886b03e", "vendor": {"name": "kvcache-ai"}}], "isExploited": false}